 "lines": [
  {
   "speaker": "header",
   "text": "CALUMET COUNTY SHERIFF'S DEPARTMENT",
   "kind": "header"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "header",
   "text": "Page 777",
   "kind": "header"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "header",
   "text": "Complaint No. 05-0157-955",
   "kind": "header"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "header",
   "text": "File Number",
   "kind": "header"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "What's that? Is she screaming?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Yeah.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "Is she screaming and saying stop what you're doing? Is she swearing at you? Is she struggling or what? Tell us how that happened.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Just that she was crying a lot.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "Are you holding her down?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "No.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "Who is?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Steven is.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "FASSBENDER",
   "text": "OK. Steven goes out and he puts her on the floor in the garage. Where does he get this knife that he stabs her with? Truthfully.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Out in the garage.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "FASSBENDER",
   "text": "So th-this knife is in the garage. And you remember the drawing you made of that knife?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Mm hum.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "FASSBENDER",
   "text": "Was that an accurate drawing or is it different? It's very important.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "It was somethin' like that.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "FASSBENDER",
   "text": "What color was it?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Black.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "FASSBENDER",
   "text": "Black handle? Where's the gun at this time?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "In the garage.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "FASSBENDER",
   "text": "He set it somewhere?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  }
 ],
